    {
      "uid": "zhcn:700e79763b9dd55547dc5fe0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她没能将那些话继续说下去。\r\n不过——已经足够了。\r\n这已经足够我理解她的想法了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b8cc8478a70d376de24dd9e2fde018b4eeed674592a44aba1cd401d1861523",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
