    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ecfa5d98413e186489dd1bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想起三年前，\r\n决定要参加闪耀・系列赛的美妙姿势。\r\n那时的她眼中闪烁着光芒，对未来激动不已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "64497966cbf2ca8a3bb6e23218d547207c46611efaf208cec21d92e60678e61f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022210.json",
      "json_path": [
